		(property "Description" "Samtec BTH-060-01-L-D-A-K-TR, 2x60 0.5 mm board-to-board receptacle. Carries rows C and D, the connector at module x = 27.200 of the PHYTEC phyCORE-AM62x PCM-071. Pin numbers are the module's own (L-1038e.A5 Tables 7-10), not Samtec's 1-120. Two of these take the module; X2 is its outline and mounting holes. Generated by tools/gen_som_symbol.py from datasheets/som_pinout.json."
